{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年49歲的名模蔣怡（Coco）向來熱愛美食，廚藝早已達專業水準。</p><p>她過去不僅以最高榮譽畢業於倫敦藍帶廚藝學院，還曾至香港中華廚藝學院研習中菜。</p><p>日前她親製燒椒醬大獲好評，更被封為「星級人妻廚神」。</p><p>好學不倦的她近日再度啟程，隻身前往四川旅遊學院</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T10:20:29.025281+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T10:01:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T10:18:05.455364+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T10:18:05.455364+00:00","content_hash":"9a41b5e2b99df2ab62e20717f50dcabc37913e83f6f0ed1a738380352565c859","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}